  "notes": [
    "Gen 3 doubles, from campaign gen3-doubles-s378 (battle 9), which diverged in R-M8-183's pre-commit replay. On boundary 24 Natu's Rock Blast strikes Skarmory's Substitute (`-activate`), breaks it with the second hit (`-end`) and hits Skarmory twice; Skarmory then makes a new doll, which Regirock's Tri Attack strikes. The first hit's `-activate` with a later strike on the holder made Skarmory a deferred doll, which R-M8-183 requires to stand after the action: a holder whose doll this action breaks is not deferred (DESIGN.md R-M8-183)."
